      "Someone is Coming",
      "",
      "Today was October 25th, a Thursday.",
      "",
      "It was 6:35 in the afternoon. Mom was eating, and I was also eating. Someone was coming.",
      "",
      "“Guoguo, come and sit here. Do you want to drink tea?” asked mom.",
      "",
      "“No thank you!” said the person. “Ah! A little cat! So pretty! What’s she called?” The person was looking at me.",
      "",
      "“She’s called Xixi,” said mom.",
      "",
      "“Hello, Xixi! I’m Guoguo,” said the person. “I’m a good friend of your mom.",
      "I’m Chinese, and my home is in Beijing. There are four people in my family.",
      "I’m studying Japanese here. Your mom and I are both university students.”",
      "",
      "“Hello!” I said.",
      "",
      "“Ah! She mewed, how fun!” said Guoguo.",
      "",
